  "backups.note.items": "settings - Chat settings and the warn limit\nantiflood - Antiflood settings\nlocks - Locks, the allowlist and warning on locks\nnotes - Notes\nfilters - Filters\nblacklist - The blacklist and its settings\njoinblacklist - The join blacklists\ngreetings - Welcome and goodbye messages\ncaptcha - Captcha settings\nrules - The rules\nwarns - Warns\napproves - Approved users",
