  "misc.hello_i_m_argo_i_m": "Hello, <b>{name}</b>! I'm <b>Argo</b>.\n\nI'm a group administration bot: moderation, role management and general crowd control.\n\nAdd me to your group, give me admin rights and I'll keep things functional. Tap <b>Help</b> below to see what I can do.",
