  "misc.help.show_the_current_weather_in": "Show the current weather in a city.",
  "misc.help.show_what_i_know_about": "Show what I know about a user, bot, group or channel. Users get a User Info section (name, username, ID and, in a group, their status: Owner, Admin, Member, Muted or Banned, with Approved added, or Muted (No Captcha) while a captcha is unsolved) and an Argo Info section (bot role and Yes/No flags: Globally Banned, Whitelisted and Immune). People with a role show no flags. In a chat that belongs to a federation, a sentence at the end says whether they are fbanned (with the reason) or a fed admin. If I have no data on someone, I say so: they have to message me first, or I have to see them in a chat I am in.",
  "misc.help.show_your_telegram_id_plus": "Show your Telegram ID, plus the chat's ID when you use it in a group. Give a user, group or channel to see their ID instead.",
